 us to apply our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/onemain-holdings-inc-omf-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"OMF 2019 Q3","e":"omf","d":"2019-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas H. Shulman","x":"driven by the release of a valuation allowance and some of our state deferred -- deferred tax assets which came from a combination of our strong earnings growth and our internal continued efforts to streamline our legal entity structure was the big items for the quarter, I would call out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/onemain-holdings-inc-omf-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"OMF 2019 Q3","e":"omf","d":"2019-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas H. Shulman","x":"And I talked about our streamline loan application, making sure it's easy to apply with us, the instructions are clear, that you can pre-populate it as much as possible to making it easier on folks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/onemain-holdings-inc-omf-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"OMF 2020 Q3","e":"omf","d":"2020-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Barker","x":"It seems like you're having a decent amount of pricing power just given the environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/onemain-holdings-inc-omf-q3-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"OMF 2020 Q4","e":"omf","d":"2021-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Micah R. Conrad","x":"I would also consider the fact that we're operating also and starting from a much lower 2020 base, due to some of the aggressive cost cutting actions we took in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/09/onemain-holdings-inc-omf-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"OMF 2021 Q1","e":"omf","d":"2021-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Micah Conrad","x":"But given the difference in originations activity, last year's cost cutting, I would point you more toward sequential comparisons through 2021 with like moderate increase of $5 million to $10 million per quarter as we ramp-up some of our spending initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/onemain-holdings-inc-omf-q1-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"OMF 2021 Q2","e":"omf","d":"2021-07-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Micah Conrad","x":"Reiterating the guidance that we provided on our last call, we expect full year interest expense in the range of 5% to 5.2%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/onemain-holdings-inc-omf-q2-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"OMF 2025 Q3","e":"omf","d":"2025-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Douglas H. Shulman","x":"And so we are always on the lookout, and I do think there still remains very broadly for the U.S. economy some macro uncertainty, whether it's around tariffs or what's going to happen with interest rates, etcetera.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/02/onemain-omf-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OMF 2025 Q4","e":"omf","d":"2026-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas H. Shulman","x":"And I'm excited to share that we recently partnered with Ally Financial to form a pass-through arrangement on their ClearPass program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/onemain-omf-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OMF 2025 Q4","e":"omf","d":"2026-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas H. Shulman","x":"It sends one to Ally, and we're now in the pass-through, which is basically a turndown program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/onemain-omf-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OMF 2025 Q4","e":"omf","d":"2026-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas H. Shulman","x":"…we roll something whether it's expanded debt consolidation, even prepopulating VINs in auto for our customers or our stream